          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Before you come",
            "text": "<p>The questions we're asked most about workshops.</p>",
            "button_label": "Ask us anything",
            "link": "/pages/contact",
            "question_1": "Do I need any experience?",
            "answer_1": "<p>None at all. Most people at our weekend sessions have never touched a wheel.</p>",
            "question_2": "When can I collect my piece?",
            "answer_2": "<p>About three weeks later, once it has been trimmed, glazed and fired. We'll message you when it's ready, or courier it within Chennai.</p>",
            "question_3": "What should I wear?",
            "answer_3": "<p>Comfortable clothes you don't mind getting clay on. We provide aprons. Short nails help.</p>",
            "question_4": "Can I change my date?",
            "answer_4": "<p>Yes, up to 48 hours before your session. After that, you can send a friend in your place.</p>",
            "question_5": "Is there a minimum age?",
            "answer_5": "<p>Participants should be 12 or older. Under 16s need an adult with them.</p>",
            "color_scheme": "scheme-2"
          }
        }
      },
